### 1. Verificar se a API está funcionando
GET http://localhost:3000/

### 2. Cadastrar Funcionário
POST http://localhost:3000/funcionario
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Marcos",
    "email": "marcos@gmail.com",
    "senha": "789"
}

### 3. Fazer Login
# @name loginReq
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "carlos@gmail.com",
    "senha": "123"
}

### 4. Listar Motoristas (Privado)
GET http://localhost:3000/motoristas
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 5. Cadastrar Motorista 1
POST http://localhost:3000/motorista
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "nome": "Ana",
    "cnh": "12345678904",
    "cpf": "12345678915",
    "telefone": "48999998888"
}

### 6. Listar Motoristas
GET http://localhost:3000/motoristas
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 7. Consultar Motoristas
GET http://localhost:3000/motorista/1
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 8. Consultar Motorista por Nome
GET http://localhost:3000/motorista/buscarNome/Marcos
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 9. Atualizar Motorista
PUT http://localhost:3000/motorista/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "nome": "Marcos Atualizado",
    "telefone": "48999990000"
}

### 10. Cadastrar Carga para o Motorista 1
POST http://localhost:3000/carga
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "descricao": "Carga de produtos",
    "peso": 150.50,
    "volume": 20.00,
    "codRastreio": 1001,
    "idMotorista": 1
}

### 11. Cadastrar Carga para o Motorista 2
POST http://localhost:3000/carga
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "descricao": "Carga de eletrônicos",
    "peso": 80.00,
    "volume": 12.50,
    "codRastreio": 1002,
    "idMotorista": 2
}

### 12. Cadastrar Entrega da Carga 1
POST http://localhost:3000/entrega
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "cidade": "Florianópolis",
    "status": "TRANSITO",
    "data": "2026-10-27",
    "hora": "14:00:00",
    "idCarga": 1
}

### 13. Cadastrar Entrega da Carga 2
POST http://localhost:3000/entrega
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "cidade": "Tijucas",
    "status": "ENTREGUE",
    "data": "2026-10-28",
    "hora": "10:30:00",
    "idCarga": 2
}

### 14. Cadastrar Entrega da Carga 3
POST http://localhost:3000/entrega
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "cidade": "Itapema",
    "status": "ENTREGUE",
    "data": "2026-10-29",
    "hora": "10:30:00",
    "idCarga": 3
}

### 15. Listar Entregas
GET http://localhost:3000/entregas
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 16. Deletar Motorista 2
DELETE http://localhost:3000/motorista/5
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}